  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till samarbete mellan LSU, UNDESA och 8 ungdomorganisationer i Afrika i syfte att bygga kunskap kring fattigdomsstrategier i syfte och &#xF6;ka unga m&#xE4;nniskors deltagande i dessa processer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the cooperation between UNDESA, LSU and youth  organisations from 8 African countries. The purpose is to develop knowledge and capacity about the Poverty Reduction Stratigies among the young and to emopower their participation in these processes.</narrative>
